{
    "title": "Manga Renta",
    "description": "Read your heart away! \r\nWith the Manga Renta app, buy and download tons of officially licensed exclusive manga straight from Japan, with new releases every day. \r\nGet started now and browse our collection of 7300+ titles (and counting)! \r\nWe guarantee our abundance of manga will stimulate your senses and suit your tastes!!\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat's good about Renta?\r\n1. Professionally Translated & Officially Licensed Manga\r\nWe provide only high quality translations and all of our manga has been officially licensed. Thus, every time you purchase manga on Renta! you know you are supporting your favorite artists.\r\n\r\n2. Easy on the Wallet\r\nWhile you can always purchase our manga in order to read it indefinitely, we are the only store to also offer a 48 hour rental option. This way, you can get the best quality translations and support the authors without breaking the bank. In addition to special offers every Wednesday, we also held great deals on manga every week, so don't miss it!\r\n\r\n3. Read Online & Offline\r\nYou can access our service from your smartphone, tablet or PC, anytime, anywhere! Download manga to your device using this app and read it offline. And don't worry, if anything happens to your device, all your manga is stored in your online bookshelf, so you can download it again anytime you want!\r\n\r\n4. New Manga Every Day\r\nMake sure to check back every day for new releases of officially licensed manga from popular and up-and-coming artists and authors! You can also add manga to your Wish List so we\u2019ll notify you when there is a new chapter coming out.\r\n\r\n\r\nCustomer Support\r\nhttps://www.ebookrenta.com/renta/sc/frm/page/help/inquiry.htm\r\nOperating Hours: Monday - Friday 9:00AM - 6:00PM (JST)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Read your heart away! <br>With the Manga Renta app, buy and download tons of officially licensed exclusive manga straight from Japan, with new releases every day. <br>Get started now and browse our collection of 7300+ titles (and counting)! <br>We guarantee our abundance of manga will stimulate your senses and suit your tastes!!<br><br><br>What&#39;s good about Renta?<br>1. Professionally Translated &amp; Officially Licensed Manga<br>We provide only high quality translations and all of our manga has been officially licensed. Thus, every time you purchase manga on Renta! you know you are supporting your favorite artists.<br><br>2. Easy on the Wallet<br>While you can always purchase our manga in order to read it indefinitely, we are the only store to also offer a 48 hour rental option. This way, you can get the best quality translations and support the authors without breaking the bank. In addition to special offers every Wednesday, we also held great deals on manga every week, so don&#39;t miss it!<br><br>3. Read Online &amp; Offline<br>You can access our service from your smartphone, tablet or PC, anytime, anywhere! Download manga to your device using this app and read it offline. And don&#39;t worry, if anything happens to your device, all your manga is stored in your online bookshelf, so you can download it again anytime you want!<br><br>4. New Manga Every Day<br>Make sure to check back every day for new releases of officially licensed manga from popular and up-and-coming artists and authors! You can also add manga to your Wish List so we\u2019ll notify you when there is a new chapter coming out.<br><br><br>Customer Support<br>https://www.ebookrenta.com/renta/sc/frm/page/help/inquiry.htm<br>Operating Hours: Monday - Friday 9:00AM - 6:00PM (JST)",
